stateDiagram-v2
    accTitle: JobState transitions
    accDescr: A queued job starts and becomes ongoing, then completes or fails. A queued job can be cancelled at once; an ongoing job moves to cancelling and the worker finishes the cancel. A failed job can be queued again while retries remain.
    [*] --> QUEUED
    QUEUED --> ONGOING: worker starts
    QUEUED --> CANCELLED: cancel before start
    ONGOING --> COMPLETED
    ONGOING --> FAILED
    ONGOING --> CANCELLING: cancel requested
    CANCELLING --> CANCELLED: worker finalizes
    FAILED --> QUEUED: retry, if retries remain
    COMPLETED --> [*]
    CANCELLED --> [*]
